The votes against were all by one person, who has not come forward to
explain eir reasons, nor has responded to my private requests to do so.
I consider voting against a proposal without explanation to be very
strongly against the spirit of this body, but I had not made this clear
in the past, so nothing will be done this time.

A note about this has been added to the Procedures section.  It is very
strongly worded.  I can't over-emphasize how important this issue is.
If people who disagree with a proposal don't explain why, we can't make
Lojban the best it can be.

